WEBVTT

00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:09.980
Have Guns

00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:12.440
Heard you got your director position back.

00:00:14.110 --> 00:00:18.610
To be precise, I'm still considered
a substitute director.

00:00:20.070 --> 00:00:23.650
You have the data, don't you?

00:00:23.650 --> 00:00:25.230
Sorry.

00:00:25.230 --> 00:00:32.110
Like I told that guy Avi, I've already
sold off that so-called data.

00:00:32.110 --> 00:00:38.650
Don't be mistaken, Juzo. I'm not here
to have some tea with you.

00:00:38.650 --> 00:00:42.070
You broke the Extend Law again.

00:00:42.070 --> 00:00:49.110
You not only destroyed a sub-brain that
was a lead to a highly wanted criminal.

00:00:49.110 --> 00:00:51.860
You assisted his escape.

00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:58.400
I'm sure you understand,
even with this sooty head of yours.

00:00:58.400 --> 00:01:04.110
Even if I send you to Wunder Bender
this very instant, you can't complain.

00:01:04.110 --> 00:01:08.780
True, I'm not in the best of situations.

00:01:08.780 --> 00:01:12.400
I got no attachments to the outside...

00:01:14.110 --> 00:01:19.440
...but I can't really let myself be put away
until I deal with a certain problem.

00:01:19.440 --> 00:01:24.190
Oh, wonderful. That simplifies matters.

00:01:24.190 --> 00:01:28.570
But even if I had that data
you're talking about,

00:01:28.570 --> 00:01:33.150
the problem I'm dealing with
right now won't let me give it up.

00:01:39.440 --> 00:01:46.400
This is why I hate people who have things
they value more than themselves.

00:01:51.530 --> 00:01:53.980
Tetsuro and Chris!

00:01:53.980 --> 00:01:57.480
Did you save them from Spitzbergen?!

00:01:57.480 --> 00:02:00.530
I wish I could say that...

00:02:02.610 --> 00:02:05.280
...but you're wrong.

00:02:05.280 --> 00:02:08.440
It seems they were released.

00:02:08.440 --> 00:02:10.480
Without a single scratch on them.

00:02:10.480 --> 00:02:12.860
What do you mean by that?

00:02:12.860 --> 00:02:14.980
We currently have them in custody,

00:02:14.980 --> 00:02:20.730
and we're checking to see
if any kind of deal was made.

00:02:20.730 --> 00:02:24.230
It'll take two or three days.

00:02:24.230 --> 00:02:28.900
Either way, I'll guarantee their safety.

00:02:32.070 --> 00:02:38.030
That means... you no longer have
a need to keep that data, right?

00:04:09.470 --> 00:04:13.440
Noble Rot

00:04:11.070 --> 00:04:13.440
My name is Podpie.

00:04:14.030 --> 00:04:18.690
I'm one of the many Extendeds
living in this city.

00:04:18.690 --> 00:04:22.570
There's no trail I can't track.

00:04:22.570 --> 00:04:30.190
I use these eyes of mine to maintain the
peace by solving cases from the shadows.

00:04:33.940 --> 00:04:37.070
Even so...

00:04:37.070 --> 00:04:43.530
No matter how hard I try, there is a limit
to what can be done by the books.

00:04:43.530 --> 00:04:49.650
In order to further sharpen my skills,

00:04:49.650 --> 00:04:52.980
I walk the streets every night.

00:04:52.980 --> 00:04:57.860
All for the sake of my true imperative.

00:05:02.980 --> 00:05:05.570
That's...!

00:05:05.570 --> 00:05:10.440
The one visiting Juzo Inui has been
confirmed as the director of EMS.

00:05:10.440 --> 00:05:14.570
It looks like the data
has already been destroyed.

00:05:14.570 --> 00:05:20.780
It proved that the government had hidden
the dangers of extension technology!

00:05:20.780 --> 00:05:24.940
We might still make it.
Give the order to attack.

00:05:24.940 --> 00:05:27.030
We won't make a mistake this time.

00:05:29.860 --> 00:05:32.320
What is it? An enemy attack?!

00:05:32.320 --> 00:05:35.820
No, I think there's a drunkard
causing problems...

00:05:35.820 --> 00:05:37.860
I feel a disgusting presence.

00:05:37.860 --> 00:05:40.650
It may be an ambush set by EMS.

00:05:40.650 --> 00:05:43.190
It can't be helped if we've
been discovered! Let's kill them!

00:05:43.190 --> 00:05:45.360
Don't engage in pointless battles!

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:49.230
Fall back. We'll report to the elder.

00:05:49.230 --> 00:05:51.030
Understood.

00:06:04.480 --> 00:06:07.780
Goodness. Please don't laugh so much.

00:06:07.780 --> 00:06:13.110
B-But the way you described Juzo
made him seem so cool.

00:06:13.110 --> 00:06:14.980
That's not the same guy.

00:06:14.980 --> 00:06:18.110
But don't you think he's an amazing person?

00:06:18.110 --> 00:06:22.400
He ignored the dangers and
saved me when I was kidnapped.

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:25.980
Even though I said such terrible things...

00:06:25.980 --> 00:06:29.610
Oh, I don't think he worries
about that kind of thing.

00:06:29.610 --> 00:06:31.780
That would be nice, but...

00:06:31.780 --> 00:06:38.190
The coat I borrowed from Mr. Juzo
got so tattered, right?

00:06:38.190 --> 00:06:39.530
Yeah.

00:06:39.530 --> 00:06:42.400
I was wondering if I could fix it myself.

00:06:43.690 --> 00:06:49.480
I read in a magazine that men
value handmade presents more.

00:06:49.480 --> 00:06:51.360
Really?

00:06:51.360 --> 00:06:55.650
Should I send a new one, after all?

00:06:55.650 --> 00:07:00.360
But I feel like that won't
properly convey my feelings...

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:05.400
I see. So that's how it is.

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:08.440
O-Of appreciation!
My feelings of appreciation!

00:07:08.440 --> 00:07:11.940
I mean, Juzo is super dense.

00:07:11.940 --> 00:07:16.900
You have to say things strongly
and clearly for him to understand!

00:07:20.150 --> 00:07:22.650
You're right.

00:07:22.650 --> 00:07:27.190
I'm now free to go wherever I please.

00:07:27.190 --> 00:07:28.900
I will try my best.

00:07:31.400 --> 00:07:33.480
That's the spirit.

00:07:45.610 --> 00:07:48.530
Juzo should be in his office right now.

00:07:48.530 --> 00:07:50.320
Y-Yes.

00:08:03.320 --> 00:08:04.900
R-Rosa?!

00:08:04.900 --> 00:08:08.610
I never thought you were
that kind of person, Mr. Juzo!

00:08:08.610 --> 00:08:11.190
N-No. What? Huh?!

00:08:11.190 --> 00:08:18.650
Even if mankind has evolved with extension
technology, man himself does not change.

00:08:37.440 --> 00:08:43.280
May there be mercy upon his manhood.

00:08:47.070 --> 00:08:49.690
It looks like she got the wrong idea.

00:08:49.690 --> 00:08:50.980
You...

00:08:50.980 --> 00:08:55.070
Juzo, you're the one in the wrong here.

00:08:55.070 --> 00:08:58.530
Hurry up and hand over the data.

00:09:12.690 --> 00:09:16.030
So that was McMahon's daughter...

00:09:34.480 --> 00:09:38.230
The time has come.

00:09:39.650 --> 00:09:44.440
Either way, I'm glad
the two of them are safe.

00:09:44.440 --> 00:09:50.780
Well, if Christina didn't come back
for a while, I could wait on the rent.

00:09:50.780 --> 00:09:52.150
Dad!

00:09:52.150 --> 00:09:56.480
After all that commotion, I haven't
had any customers come in.

00:09:56.480 --> 00:10:00.570
When someone finally does...
it's a head like yours.

00:10:01.690 --> 00:10:06.030
At this rate, my cutting skills
are going to drop.

00:10:06.030 --> 00:10:11.320
B-B-B-But I'm thankful that everyone is safe.

00:10:11.320 --> 00:10:15.230
I heard that you were going to raid
a terrorist organization, Mr. Juzo.

00:10:15.230 --> 00:10:18.070
I was so w-worried...

00:10:18.070 --> 00:10:21.070
There's no need to worry
about a guy like that.

00:10:21.070 --> 00:10:24.650
He even came back with newly sprouted arms!

00:10:24.650 --> 00:10:27.900
Don't talk about it
like I'm some kind of lizard.

00:10:28.900 --> 00:10:32.780
Those arms of yours. Are they Mary's work?

00:10:32.780 --> 00:10:33.730
No, this is--

00:10:33.730 --> 00:10:36.690
That girl is popular.

00:10:36.690 --> 00:10:39.480
Her skills have improved once again.

00:10:39.480 --> 00:10:41.780
She's so young, but so talented.

00:10:41.780 --> 00:10:44.530
I should have her do my
maintenance work sometime.

00:10:44.530 --> 00:10:50.320
While I'm at it, maybe I should upgrade
to something that looks more trendy.

00:10:50.320 --> 00:10:52.070
That's a good idea.

00:10:52.070 --> 00:10:56.360
You should also have her set it
so you talk a little less.

00:10:57.320 --> 00:10:59.030
Welcome!

00:11:00.940 --> 00:11:03.610
Uh, did you want to get a cut?

00:11:03.610 --> 00:11:05.360
D-Dad!

00:11:05.360 --> 00:11:11.940
If so, I'm helping another customer
right now, so it'll be a bit of a wait.

00:11:11.940 --> 00:11:13.610
Just a shampoo.

00:11:13.610 --> 00:11:16.320
Oh! I-I can do that!

00:11:16.320 --> 00:11:18.320
Will that be all right?

00:11:18.320 --> 00:11:19.320
Please.

00:11:19.320 --> 00:11:22.690
I'll h-hang up your coat for you.

00:11:24.480 --> 00:11:27.230
P-Please sit down over here.

00:11:31.820 --> 00:11:36.780
After investigating day
and night, I've finally...

00:11:36.780 --> 00:11:39.280
Excuse my reach.

00:11:39.280 --> 00:11:42.440
My efforts have borne fruit!

00:11:46.730 --> 00:11:48.980
Wh-What's going on?!

00:11:48.980 --> 00:11:54.400
U-U-Um, did I do something wrong?

00:11:54.400 --> 00:11:58.530
No. There's no problem.

00:11:58.530 --> 00:12:00.570
I-I'm going to lower the seat now.

00:12:00.570 --> 00:12:03.570
All right, turn back over this way.

00:12:03.570 --> 00:12:07.320
I'm going to put a towel over you now.

00:12:07.320 --> 00:12:12.030
Is th-th-there any water down your temples?

00:12:12.030 --> 00:12:14.070
There's no problem.

00:12:15.070 --> 00:12:19.230
Are you on your way home from work today?

00:12:20.320 --> 00:12:23.690
What kind of work do you do?

00:12:27.110 --> 00:12:29.360
The world...

00:12:29.360 --> 00:12:32.900
I make the dreams of all men
in this world come true.

00:12:32.900 --> 00:12:37.980
That is the duty I bear.

00:12:37.980 --> 00:12:39.690
D-Duty?!

00:12:39.690 --> 00:12:41.980
Now that makes me curious, old man.

00:12:41.980 --> 00:12:47.980
If you are truly a man, a time will come
when I may help you as well.

00:12:47.980 --> 00:12:51.360
A man of few words, huh?

00:12:51.360 --> 00:12:55.150
I don't hate those kinds of people.

00:13:07.820 --> 00:13:11.860
Inhuman previous guest
who I do not know the name of,

00:13:11.860 --> 00:13:15.480
allow me to be thankful of your work.

00:13:17.650 --> 00:13:22.530
I-It seems your job must be an admirable one.

00:13:23.980 --> 00:13:28.280
I was able to gain this moment thanks to you!

00:13:28.280 --> 00:13:33.650
The perfect chance for me to fulfill my duties!

00:13:44.940 --> 00:13:47.070
Oh, no! What a terrible nosebleed!

00:13:47.070 --> 00:13:49.280
There's no problem. Continue.

00:13:49.280 --> 00:13:50.530
B-B-But...

00:13:50.530 --> 00:13:52.030
Excuse me.

00:13:52.030 --> 00:13:55.190
I'd like to get my hair washed.
Do you have time?

00:13:55.190 --> 00:13:57.360
I've been holding off
because of everything going on,

00:13:57.360 --> 00:14:00.820
but it's been a week and
I can't stand this itchiness!

00:14:00.820 --> 00:14:03.440
Oh! Juzo is here, too.

00:14:03.440 --> 00:14:07.230
Rosa was here just a bit ago. Did you see her?

00:14:07.230 --> 00:14:11.110
Wait... why is there so much blood?!

00:14:11.110 --> 00:14:12.780
Th-That's...

00:14:12.780 --> 00:14:14.690
No way. Juzo...

00:14:14.690 --> 00:14:16.730
It wasn't me!

00:14:24.400 --> 00:14:26.980
Those eyes...

00:14:26.980 --> 00:14:29.070
I've seen them somewhere.

00:14:30.280 --> 00:14:33.940
Don't put such pathetic things
in front of my face!

00:14:33.940 --> 00:14:37.690
And you smell so bad! Have some shame!

00:14:37.690 --> 00:14:40.610
Wh-What are you...?

00:14:43.690 --> 00:14:47.780
Y-Y-You!

00:15:03.320 --> 00:15:07.780
Dad! Get a towel! Hurry!

00:15:09.940 --> 00:15:13.980
What's going on? What did he do?

00:15:13.980 --> 00:15:18.230
I am a person from the Security Bureau!
I have connections with the EMS as well!

00:15:18.230 --> 00:15:22.190
If you harm me, you will not be--

00:15:20.070 --> 00:15:22.190
Shut up!

00:15:24.610 --> 00:15:27.110
I knew it!

00:15:27.110 --> 00:15:29.110
Th-That's...

00:15:29.110 --> 00:15:31.360
What is that? Let me see.

00:15:31.360 --> 00:15:33.530
Don't look!

00:15:33.530 --> 00:15:41.320
This person has an image scanning device
that uses the MALS system.

00:15:41.320 --> 00:15:45.150
Multiple Alternative Light Sources.

00:15:45.150 --> 00:15:52.820
It's a system that uses ultraviolet and
infrared light to find hidden evidence.

00:15:52.820 --> 00:15:58.730
It was developed for the Security Bureau
and the government research facilities.

00:15:58.730 --> 00:16:03.320
That technology was installed
in his eyes as an extension.

00:16:03.320 --> 00:16:07.230
I don't really get it.
So, just what did this guy do?

00:16:07.230 --> 00:16:11.980
To put it simply, he has the power
to see hidden things.

00:16:11.980 --> 00:16:13.730
It's x-ray vision!

00:16:13.730 --> 00:16:16.190
X-ray vision?!

00:16:16.190 --> 00:16:20.480
Of course, this technology
isn't available to the public.

00:16:20.480 --> 00:16:22.440
So, it's an illegal extension.

00:16:22.440 --> 00:16:26.820
Even considering the risks,
it's a fairly affordable extension.

00:16:26.820 --> 00:16:31.230
That's why illegal extensions
like this are so popular.

00:16:31.230 --> 00:16:33.190
Then, this guy...

00:16:33.190 --> 00:16:36.530
He's probably lying about being
part of the Security Bureau.

00:16:36.530 --> 00:16:38.980
I'm not lying!

00:16:38.980 --> 00:16:43.280
I really was a data analyst
from the Security Bureau.

00:16:43.280 --> 00:16:46.360
However, after getting these eyes,

00:16:46.360 --> 00:16:52.530
my desire to use them for personal
gain had become uncontrollable!

00:16:52.530 --> 00:16:56.610
That was the only reason I was fired!

00:17:03.440 --> 00:17:08.610
Then, the duty you were talking about earlier...

00:17:08.610 --> 00:17:16.150
I must show the beautiful bodies that have
caught my eye to all the men in the world.

00:17:16.150 --> 00:17:21.190
That! That is the true duty of John Podpie!

00:17:21.190 --> 00:17:24.320
Why are you saying that so proudly?!

00:17:24.320 --> 00:17:26.440
I was able to extract all the data.

00:17:26.440 --> 00:17:28.980
Let's just hand this guy over to the EMS!

00:17:28.980 --> 00:17:30.820
What did you say?!

00:17:30.820 --> 00:17:36.230
What a foolish thing to do!
Your heart must be as barren as your chest!

00:17:36.230 --> 00:17:40.190
Quit saying barren over and over!

00:17:42.110 --> 00:17:46.360
You fools do not realize
the importance of my work!

00:17:46.360 --> 00:17:51.280
You are the ones who took my job
and my family from me!

00:17:51.280 --> 00:17:53.440
This flimsy bucket!

00:17:53.440 --> 00:17:56.610
It cannot contain the light
of my all-seeing eyes!

00:17:56.610 --> 00:18:01.280
I will bring all of your secrets to light!

00:18:01.280 --> 00:18:05.860
I shall bring you complete humiliation!

00:18:18.280 --> 00:18:23.320
Wh-Wh-What kind of body is that?

00:18:23.320 --> 00:18:24.650
Shut up.

00:18:26.030 --> 00:18:29.780
You suddenly became so freaking talkative.

00:18:29.780 --> 00:18:34.070
What're you doing to someone that could be
the same age as your daughter?

00:18:36.230 --> 00:18:43.530
It's your duty as an adult to admit
your crime instead of lashing back like this.

00:18:43.530 --> 00:18:45.280
U-Um...

00:18:45.280 --> 00:18:46.480
Here.

00:18:49.530 --> 00:18:53.530
What was that just now? What was that
just now? What was that just now?

00:18:53.530 --> 00:19:01.030
What was that just now?
What was that just now? What? What?

00:18:54.280 --> 00:18:56.570
He's a goner.

00:18:59.070 --> 00:19:01.030
It's fine!

00:19:04.650 --> 00:19:08.690
I'm sure he had his reasons.

00:19:08.690 --> 00:19:15.570
We've gotten the images back...
so as long as he promises not to do it again...

00:19:15.570 --> 00:19:16.730
Huh?!

00:19:16.730 --> 00:19:18.900
Hey, that's being way too nice!

00:19:18.900 --> 00:19:22.030
But he seems to have regretted what he's done.

00:19:22.030 --> 00:19:25.070
No, no. You can't let him go like this.

00:19:25.070 --> 00:19:26.690
Please open your eyes!

00:19:26.690 --> 00:19:29.570
--It'll be fine.
--No, do you really understand?
He saw you?! All of you!

00:19:26.690 --> 00:19:29.570
What about you?

00:19:29.570 --> 00:19:31.400
No, do you really understand?
He saw you?! All of you!

00:19:29.570 --> 00:19:31.400
Even if you ask me that...

00:19:31.400 --> 00:19:33.030
Well, that's true, but...

00:19:31.400 --> 00:19:36.910
I can't even use that head
of his to practice cutting hair.

00:19:33.030 --> 00:19:36.610
What? It's okay?! Really?!

00:19:36.610 --> 00:19:38.150
It's fine!

00:19:40.110 --> 00:19:44.730
What was that just now? What was that
just now? What was that just now?

00:19:44.730 --> 00:19:49.820
Wh-What? What was that? What?

00:19:49.820 --> 00:19:51.820
You forgot something.

00:19:53.030 --> 00:20:00.110
That power of yours. Try using it for
something you <i>really</i> believe is right.

00:20:00.110 --> 00:20:08.940
If you drown in that power again,
the last thing you'll see is my fist.

00:20:13.940 --> 00:20:15.820
And, you know...

00:20:17.690 --> 00:20:22.230
If you don't watch out,
you'll just end up becoming a tool.

00:20:23.820 --> 00:20:27.280
It's like you were saying
those words to yourself.

00:20:28.570 --> 00:20:30.320
You think?

00:20:30.320 --> 00:20:32.570
I do.

00:20:32.570 --> 00:20:38.320
Verrat Dreizhen. The brethren slayer, Device 13!

00:20:38.320 --> 00:20:41.570
The anecdotes of you stained in blood!

00:20:44.440 --> 00:20:49.780
In the past, there was a unit
called the Noble Rot.

00:20:55.650 --> 00:21:01.940
Soldiers who dropped to rock bottom
for the sake of their country.

00:21:01.940 --> 00:21:06.440
They seemed noble for
giving themselves to the rot.

00:21:08.280 --> 00:21:10.440
Was that...

00:21:12.360 --> 00:21:18.230
His abilities still have ways
to be used for good.

00:21:18.230 --> 00:21:21.110
He's different from me.

00:21:24.360 --> 00:21:25.860
Well, then.

00:21:25.860 --> 00:21:28.820
Old man, please finish taking care of me.

00:21:28.820 --> 00:21:30.940
Oh! But!

00:21:34.360 --> 00:21:40.690
But... There are people
who've been saved by you, too.

00:21:42.150 --> 00:21:44.030
Juzo.

00:23:27.400 --> 00:23:31.070
You aren't surprised seeing my face?

00:23:29.230 --> 00:23:32.940
Well, well. What an utterly
unexpected turn of events!

00:23:31.070 --> 00:23:35.400
I've never seen you on the military register.

00:23:32.940 --> 00:23:35.400
I'm sorry. Please forgive me!

00:23:35.400 --> 00:23:42.030
<i>NO GUNS LIFE</i> . Episode 18.
"Traces of Crime."
